### Implementation Details

The Analytics component is correctly imported and placed in the root layout:

```typescript
import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";

export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body>
        <Analytics /> {/* Vercel Analytics - Has use limit */}
        {/* ... rest of the app */}
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

This follows the official Vercel documentation's recommended setup for Next.js App Router projects.

