## Next Steps for Verification

After deployment to Vercel:
1. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard (Analytics section)
2. Visit your deployed site and check the browser's Network tab
3. Look for Fetch/XHR requests to `/<unique-path>/view`
4. Verify analytics data appears in the Vercel dashboard

